cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the source atmosphere grids used."
title: "Atmosphere Contrast"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Amanpreet
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Calculate thermal planet-to-star contrasts from emergent surface spectra
  using explicit filter and atmospheric transmission curves. This review
  module supplies a scalar brightness ratio for downstream applications.
keywords:
  - exoplanets
  - atmosphere models
  - synthetic photometry
  - thermal contrast

